  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that configurations using scvi_n200 RNA encoder and imagenet_vit_l image encoder with concat fusion (e.g., config_049) achieve high accuracy. However, config_047 tests scgpt RNA encoder with resnet50 image encoder and transformer aggregation/concat fusion, which is a novel combination. This experiment will clarify if switching RNA encoders (scgpt vs. scvi_n200) and image encoders (resnet50 vs. imagenet_vit_l) can further improve performance, balancing exploration of new design choices against the strong prior evidence for scvi_n200."
}

